        </Box>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>从已受影响的办公终端出发，验证关键数据是否可达</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.14)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
