            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(231,129,114,0.30)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172' }}>ATTACK_STATE</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>LEARNING OBJECTIVES</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 区分网络通信路径与攻击状态路径</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 观察权限、教学条件与安全控制如何共同判定</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 验证通信允许不会自动改变目标状态</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WATCH FOR</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>T0 USER → T1 USER → T2 ADMIN → T3 DATA_ACCESS；每一跳都要重新过条件。</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>TASK</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>保护 Customer Database，同时保持办公 Web 与应用数据库业务可达。</Text>

